  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça va pas être possible !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020007600610020007000610073002000EA00740072006500200070006F0073007300690062006C0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trouvez une solution !\nC’est votre travail !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540072006F007500760065007A00200075006E006500200073006F006C007500740069006F006E00200021000A0043201900650073007400200076006F0074007200650020007400720061007600610069006C002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ! Tu tombes à pic !\nAide-moi, je t’en supplie !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C002000100002010000000020002100200054007500200074006F006D006200650073002000E0002000700069006300200021000A0041006900640065002D006D006F0069002C0020006A00650020007420190065006E00200073007500700070006C0069006500200021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai proposé à ce monsieur de porter ses affaires,\nmais faut voir ce qu’il me demande de soulever !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nC’est impossible à porter, donc j’ai refusé...\nEt maintenant, il me provoque en duel !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 194
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais enfin, je vous ai juste demandé de porter\nmon petit Galeking. C’est pas la mer à boire !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "« Petit » ? Mais enfin ! Il pèse 360 kilos !\nVous voyez bien que c’est impossible !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je veux rien savoir !\nVous êtes une incapable, voilà tout !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLe client a toujours raison, et je vais vous en faire\nun rappel musclé ! À tou<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȀtes les deux, s’il le faut !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 179
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis venu à Illumis pour me mesurer\nau Royale Z-A !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi je peux pas battre des minus comme vous,\nautant ne pas m’inscrire du tout !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je réussirai jamais à le raisonner...\nS’il te plaît, affronte-le avec moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux bien l’affronter avec moi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000760065007500780020006200690065006E0020006C20190061006600660072006F006E007400650072002000610076006500630020006D006F00690020003F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien sûr !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E0020007300FB0072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah bon... Mais quand alors ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006800200062006F006E002E002E002E0020004D0061006900730020007100750061006E006400200061006C006F007200730020003F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est fou, la vie. Dire qu’on s’est rencontré<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀes\nparce que Pandespiègle avait pris tes affaires...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Encore désolée pour les soucis qu’on t’a causés...\nEt merci d’accepter de m’aider malgré tout !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon Galeking et moi, on va vous montrer ce qui\narrive quand on refuse de servir la clientèle !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça alors... À Illumis, on prend pas les combats\nà la légère !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C7006100200061006C006F00720073002E002E002E002000C000200049006C006C0075006D00690073002C0020006F006E0020007000720065006E006400200070006100730020006C0065007300200063006F006D0062006100740073000A00E00020006C00610020006C00E9006700E80072006500200021001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est décidé ! J’abandonne le Royale Z-A et je vais\nfaire du tourisme ! Ensuite, je rentre chez moi !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Porter un Galeking, franchement ! S’il avait été\nplus raisonnable, je lui aurais bien servi de guide...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "’Spiègle !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201900530070006900E80067006C0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci de m’avoir aidée ! Je m’y attendais pas,\naprès ce qu’il s’est passé avec mon Pandespiègle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais tu sais, quand je l’ai vu avec ton sac,\nça m’a donné une idée.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200074007500200073006100690073002C0020007100750061006E00640020006A00650020006C2019006100690020007600750020006100760065006300200074006F006E0020007300610063002C000A00E700610020006D2019006100200064006F006E006E00E900200075006E006500200069006400E90065002E001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai créé un service deux-en-un !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPendant qu’on guide les touristes, nos Pokémon\ntransportent leurs bagages !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eux, ils peuvent passer par des endroits qui nous\nsont inaccessibles. Donc c’est pratique, tu vois ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allô ? T’es où ? Je te vois pas...\nTout va bien ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ-",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C00F40020003F002000542019006500730020006F00F90020003F0020004A006500200074006500200076006F006900730020007000610073002E002E002E000A0054006F007500740020007600610020006200690065006E0020003F001000020114002D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui, oui, André ! Ça va !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002C0020006F00750069002C00200041006E0064007200E900200021002000C7006100200076006100200021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai eu un petit souci, mais c’est réglé.\nJ’arrive !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200065007500200075006E00200070006500740069007400200073006F007500630069002C0020006D0061006900730020006320190065007300740020007200E90067006C00E9002E000A004A201900610072007200690076006500200021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On raconte que tu fais un carton au Royale Z-A.\nÇa fait plaisir à entendre !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAu moins, je peux me vanter d’avoir été\nta première adversaire à Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 159
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, j’y vais ! À plus tard, j’espère !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C0020006A201900790020007600610069007300200021002000C000200070006C0075007300200074006100720064002C0020006A201900650073007000E80072006500200021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    }
